title: "PREDIX HER2 — multimodal prediction of pathological complete response"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, deposited cross-validation artefacts and a verification
  notebook for the multimodal (clinical, transcriptomic, genomic, proteomic and
  whole-slide-image) prediction of pathological complete response in the
  PREDIX HER2 randomised trial.
